# datetime(...) is one literal token when the name is directly followed by `(`.
mode: syntax
---- query
datetime(2024-01-31) datetime(2024-01-31T12:00:00Z) datetime(null) datetime (x)
---- expected
DATETIME@0..20 "datetime(2024-01-31)"
WHITESPACE@20..21 " "
DATETIME@21..51 "datetime(2024-01-31T12:00:00Z)"
WHITESPACE@51..52 " "
DATETIME@52..66 "datetime(null)"
WHITESPACE@66..67 " "
IDENT@67..75 "datetime"
WHITESPACE@75..76 " "
L_PAREN@76..77 "("
IDENT@77..78 "x"
R_PAREN@78..79 ")"
WHITESPACE@79..80 "\n"
